  "translate_en|mods/BarricadesHurtZombies/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_BarricadesHurtZombies_BaseDamage_tooltip": "The default value of 18 removes 0.18 fixed zombie HP per confirmed structure event before material and object multipliers. It is not 18%% of that zombie's health. Build 42.20 counts real ThumpFrame events; BHZ applies one damage unit per callback. Existing saves may retain an older saved value, so set this to 18 if you want the current default balance.",
